in-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ffb832ea-557a-41d1-968a-72577284be63" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-mini" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="152">Yeah — that’s probably the <code data-start="27" data-end="42">.case-details</code> grid being too tight, especially with things like <strong data-start="93" data-end="116">Additional Offenses</strong> and longer location/outcome values.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="154" data-end="261">I’d loosen the spacing without changing the overall design. Add this <strong data-start="223" data-end="260">at the very bottom of <code data-start="247" data-end="258">style.css</code></strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="263" data-end="1492"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼt">/* =========================================================
   CBRA — CASE INFORMATION SPACING
   ========================================================= */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>,
.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> {

    gap: </span><span class="ͼy">14</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">18</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">div</span><span>,
.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">div</span><span> {

    padding: </span><span class="ͼy">16</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">18</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    min-height: </span><span class="ͼy">68</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">strong</span><span>,
.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">strong</span><span> {

    display: </span><span class="ͼy">block</span><span>;
    margin-bottom: </span><span class="ͼy">7</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.2</span><span>;

}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">span</span><span>,
.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">span</span><span> {

    display: </span><span class="ͼy">block</span><span>;
    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.45</span><span>;
    overflow-wrap: </span><span class="ͼy">anywhere</span><span>;

}


</span><span class="ͼt">/* Give longer fields more breathing room */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-additional-offenses</span><span> {

    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.5</span><span>;

}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">additional-offenses-list</span><span> {

    margin: </span><span class="ͼy">6</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">0</span><span>;
    padding-left: </span><span class="ͼy">20</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">additional-offenses-list</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">li</span><span> {

    margin-bottom: </span><span class="ͼy">5</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

}


</span><span class="ͼt">/* Slightly more breathing room on smaller screens */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼv">@media</span><span> (max-width: </span><span class="ͼy">700</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>) {

    .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>,
    .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> {

        gap: </span><span class="ͼy">12</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

    }

    .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-information</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">div</span><span>,
    .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-section</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span> </span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">div</span><span> {

        padding: </span><span class="ͼy">14</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">16</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;

    }

}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1494" data-end="1685" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">This keeps the <strong data-start="1509" data-end="1547">same colors, layout, and aesthetic</strong>, but makes each information field feel more like an individual piece of a physical case file instead of everything being packed together.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.