hread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="ad1d81de-4279-4f0b-877c-cc905b7bd53a" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6-mini" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="133">Yep — if the update went through but <strong data-start="37" data-end="56">nothing changed</strong>, then <code data-start="63" data-end="82">#case-information</code> isn't the actual selector being used by your HTML.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="135" data-end="282">From the <code data-start="144" data-end="153">Case.js</code> you sent, I can see the fields are IDs like <code data-start="198" data-end="209">case-date</code>, <code data-start="211" data-end="225">case-country</code>, etc., but that doesn't tell us the parent section's ID.</p>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="284" data-end="299">Easiest fix</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="301" data-end="412">We can target the section <strong data-start="327" data-end="373">based on the <code data-start="342" data-end="353">case-date</code> element inside it</strong>, so we don't need to change your HTML.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="414" data-end="461">Add this at the <strong data-start="430" data-end="460">very bottom of <code data-start="447" data-end="458">style.css</code></strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="463" data-end="1087"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼt">/* =========================================================
   CBRA — CASE INFORMATION SPACING
   ========================================================= */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼ10">has</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-date</span><span>) {
    gap: </span><span class="ͼy">18</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">22</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼ10">has</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-date</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼv">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ13">div</span><span> {
    padding: </span><span class="ͼy">18</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼy">20</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    min-height: </span><span class="ͼy">78</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼ10">has</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-date</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼ13">strong</span><span> {
    display: </span><span class="ͼy">block</span><span>;
    margin-bottom: </span><span class="ͼy">9</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.3</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼ10">has</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-date</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼ13">span</span><span> {
    display: </span><span class="ͼy">block</span><span>;
    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.5</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼt">/* Description directly below the case information */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-description</span><span> {
    margin-top: </span><span class="ͼy">12</span><span class="ͼv">px</span><span>;
    line-height: </span><span class="ͼy">1.7</span><span>;
}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1089" data-end="1111">The important part is:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1113" data-end="1153"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>.</span><span class="ͼ10">case-details</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼ10">has</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼv">#</span><span class="ͼ13">case-date</span><span>)</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1155" data-end="1244">That specifically finds the <strong data-start="1183" data-end="1208">Case Information grid</strong>, because <code data-start="1218" data-end="1230">#case-date</code> is inside it.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1246" data-end="1333">So this <strong data-start="1254" data-end="1332">won't change the Person Information section or other <code data-start="1309" data-end="1324">.case-details</code> grids</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1335" data-end="1464" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">If you want it even more spread out after this, we can increase the individual boxes further rather than changing the whole page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.9421