ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼ13">&lt;head&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">charset</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"UTF-8"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">name</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"viewport"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">content</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>Case Archive | CBRA</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/title&gt;</span><span>

    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;link</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">rel</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"icon"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">type</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"image/png"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"images/cbra-icon.png"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;link</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">rel</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"stylesheet"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ12">href</span><span class="ͼv">=</span><span class="ͼz">"css/style.css"</span><span class="ͼ13">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼ13">&lt;/head&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1067" data-end="1104">4. Do it for every main HTML page</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1106" data-end="1130">You'll want the icon on:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1132" data-end="1262"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-07247886.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>Index.html
Archive.html
Case.html
Person.html
Statistics.html
Resources.html
Manage.html
Manage Person.html
About.html</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 dir="auto" data-start="1264" data-end="1318">5. If the grey globe doesn't disappear immediately</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1320" data-end="1369">Chrome caches favicons <strong data-start="1343" data-end="1366">really aggressively</strong> 😭</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1371" data-end="1375">Try:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1377" data-end="1397"><strong data-start="1377" data-end="1397">Ctrl + Shift + R</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1399" data-end="1473">If it still shows the globe, close the tab completely and reopen the site.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="1475" data-end="1561" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Once it's working, that little grey globe should become the <strong data-start="1535" data-end="1560">CBRA case-folder icon</strong>.</p></div></div></div><div class="w-full max-w-[480px]"><div class="border-token-border-default bg-token-bg-primary mb-2 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border"><div id="_r_r3_" class="divide-token-border-light flex flex-col divide-y"><div><div class="group/artifact-row hover:bg-token-bg-secondary/60 relative flex items-center"><button type="button" aria-label="a_flat_close_up_square_format_stylized_realist.png" class="group/open-file peer/open-file interactive-button interactive-label-primary focus-visible:ring-token-border-heavy flex min-w-0 flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 bg-transparent py-3 ps-4 pe-14 text-start focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-inset"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="size-6 shrink-0" style="color: rgb(255, 102, 173);"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.113 5.57446C13.4262 5.5745 14.491 6.63918 14.491 7.95239C14.4908 9.26547 13.4261 10.3303 12.113 10.3303C10.8 10.3302 9.73526 9.26544 9.73511 7.95239C9.73511 6.63922 10.7999 5.57455 12.113 5.57446ZM12.113 6.90454C11.5344 6.90463 11.0652 7.37375 11.0652 7.95239C11.0653 8.5309 11.5345 9.00015 12.113 9.00024C12.6916 9.0002 13.1607 8.53093 13.1609 7.95239C13.1609 7.37372 12.6917 6.90458 12.113 6.90454Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M14.1667 2.52173C16.0068 2.52173 17.4988 4.01373 17.4988 5.85376V14.1868C17.4988 16.0268 16.0068 17.5188 14.1667 17.5188H5.83374C3.99371 17.5188 2.50171 16.0268 2.50171 14.1868V5.85376C2.50171 4.01373 3.99371 2.52173 5.83374 2.52173H14.1667ZM5.83374 3.85181C4.72825 3.85181 3.83179 4.74827 3.83179 5.85376V11.9524L5.05249 10.7317C5.96295 9.82123 7.43974 9.82144 8.35034 